<title>UK: London Tea Auction price indications.</title>
<headline>London Tea Auction price indications.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>At today's London landed Tea Auction of 9,545 packages of 53.50 kgs, including 1,000 offshore, price indications in pence a kilo compared to the last sale and the corresponding week last year.</p>
<p>    Best available  208   (299 and 272)</p>
<p>    Good		136   (135 and 140)</p>
<p>    Good Medium     120   (116 and 106)</p>
<p>    Medium	    107   (107 and  86)</p>
<p>    Low Medium	 85   ( 85 and  68)</p>
<p>The highest price paid was 208 pence for a North Indian PF.</p>
</text>
